        },
        {
          "step_number": 10,
          "title": "Step 10",
          "instruction": "Add the cr\u00e8me fra\u00eeche (or sour cream). Bring the soup back to a simmer and once the soup begins to bubble again turn off the heat. Keep the soup on the burner and add the fish. Let the fish cook in the hot soup for 5 minutes. If using shrimp, add right before serving."
